// # LSP Type System
//
// Logline: The wire type system: LspFrame, LspDoc, LspServerState, LspDiagnostic, LspCodeAction.
//
// Setup: Pure type definitions. No I/O. Used by every other subdir.
//
// Beats:
//   1. 1 files implementing the types layer.
//   2. All files follow the 4-element Academy header and the 256-line cap.
//   3. Imports go to siblings in this subdir; cross-subdir imports use the new lsp/<subdir>/<file> path.

import "lsp_types.oo";
